{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>For the tabernacle, standing boards of acacia wood</b> — in gematria: לכפר למעשה שטים (to atone for the deed of Shittim). 24 times שטים in the parashah (excluding those in צוואה and עשייה which are needed for their own context) corresponding to 24,000 who fell at Shittim. 48 boards corresponding to 48 prophets and 48 priestly and Levitical watches. And there were 7 bars corresponding to seven generations from Abraham to Moses and the seven shepherds."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:29.327635310Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}